Package: namematch
Title: Fuzzy Matching of Messy Name Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Frank", "Adonteng", email = "adontengfrank58@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Matches rows of one table of person names to rows of a
    reference table using a sequence of independent, pipeable steps: exact
    names, token sets, Jaro-Winkler typos, Soundex, nicknames, first word,
    first initial and compound last names. Optional shared variables (such
    as zip code) can block candidates, break ties and verify fuzzy matches,
    and a summary reports what each step contributed.
